### Bloomberg replies ###
# Real .out files are development samples and stay out of the repository: they
# carry a firm name, a Data License account and the securities that account is
# entitled to. Drop your own into src/test/resources and the fixture-driven
# tests pick them up; without them those tests skip and the rest still run on
# samples written into the test sources.
src/test/resources/*.out